      <text>ALG2_U06_L02_GP_Q05</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U06_L02_GP_Q05</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> Support-only readiness; no new primary MLA standard</p><p>What is the 6th term of 5, 8, 11, 14, ...?</p>]]></text>
